Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.10,0:00:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Great product. Flat copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet CopyCoach — your AI copywriting coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Free: five credits a day. Pro: a hundred monthly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Paste your copy. Add your context.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your audience and call to action.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tone. Your language.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Improve — and the frameworks get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Conversion Score: 85. Conversion ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A sharper rewrite — copy it, export it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why it works — so you learn as you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Writing quality, scored in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Saved to your library, automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Star what works. Reuse it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Projects — every campaign in one place.
